    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. i was worried about the \"exclusive use\" part though. like, if i sit in it to play games at night too, does that totally disqualify the whole thing? or is there a way to just deduct a portion of it? also, i lost a receipt for a different smaller piece of equipment last month, does that matter a lot for the audit trail?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
