      "content": "okay, thanks. i'll try to dig through my bank statements for that missing receipt. one more thing—i've been noticing some weird stuff with my small business account lately. a few small digital transactions i don't recognize just showed up, and some of my older invoices seem to have been paid, but the money isn't showing up in my balance like it should. it's like things are just... vanishing or getting mismanaged. is that something that usually happens when you're doing a lot of bookkeeping, or should i be worried about something more serious like fraud or errors in the software?",
